      // Transitions to WAIT_DATA3 on a 2
      // Transitions to WAIT_DATA4 on a 3
      // Transitions to WAIT_DATA5 on a 4
      // Transitions to WAIT_DATA6 on a 5
      // Transitions to WAIT_DATA7 on a 6
      // Transitions to WAIT_DATA8 on a 7
